WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.472
"It's springtime!" shouted Mole.

2
00:00:09.473 --> 00:00:11.681
"Smell that fresh air!

3
00:00:11.682 --> 00:00:16.577
But my house is so dusty and dirty," he said.

4
00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:18.169
"I need a bucket.

5
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.535
I need a mop.

6
00:00:19.536 --> 00:00:23.196
It's time to clean!"

7
00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:26.446
He stood on a ladder to dust a bookcase.

8
00:00:26.447 --> 00:00:29.476
He moved a chair to clean under it.

9
00:00:29.477 --> 00:00:34.261
He even polished the doorknobs!

10
00:00:34.262 --> 00:00:36.763
"The kitchen is spotless!

11
00:00:36.764 --> 00:00:39.857
The pots and pans are all washed.

12
00:00:39.858 --> 00:00:44.006
The floor is next," said Mole.

13
00:00:44.007 --> 00:00:49.069
Back and forth Mole scrubbed the floor.

14
00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.612
"Ow!" he groaned.

15
00:00:51.613 --> 00:00:53.582
"My back is sore.

16
00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:57.115
My arms are sore too."

17
00:00:57.116 --> 00:01:00.289
Mole threw the scrub brush down.

18
00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:03.164
"Forget it!" he said.

19
00:01:03.165 --> 00:01:05.978
Mole grabbed his blue coat.

20
00:01:05.979 --> 00:01:10.462
He ran up a tunnel to the outside.

21
00:01:10.463 --> 00:01:13.760
"Up we go! Up we go!"

22
00:01:13.761 --> 00:01:16.834
Mole's head popped out of his hole.

23
00:01:16.835 --> 00:01:20.974
"Wow, the sun is bright!"

24
00:01:20.975 --> 00:01:23.030
Mole jumped out.

25
00:01:23.031 --> 00:01:27.094
"The grass smells sweet," he said.

26
00:01:27.095 --> 00:01:29.523
He rolled in the grass.

27
00:01:29.524 --> 00:01:31.906
He chased the butterflies.

28
00:01:31.907 --> 00:01:37.610
"This is so much better than cleaning!" said Mole.

29
00:01:37.611 --> 00:01:40.546
He ran across the meadow.

30
00:01:40.547 --> 00:01:43.553
"Stop!" yelled an old rabbit.

31
00:01:43.554 --> 00:01:48.198
"You must pay six pennies to run through here!"

